/target
# The build's param declaration: a per-BINARY fact, regenerated on every build.
# Committing it would assert whichever platform built last as the project's.
x-engine-build.xon

# The engine binary copied to the root, where x-lang's engine-directory
# convention expects to find the file `(binary "x-engine")` names. Built
# output either way -- the canonical copy is target/release/x-engine.
/x-engine
